# === Secrets (never commit) ==========================
# The real API key (config_local.json) is kept OUTSIDE the repo (parent folder).
# Also block real key files accidentally left in the repo root / code folder:
/config_local.json
code/config_local.json
config_local.local.json
.env
# configs/config_local.json (empty template) is tracked
!configs/config_local.json

# === Data / outputs (large, excluded from the repo) ==
data/
outputs/
raw/
*.csv
*.tsv
*.jsonl
*.xlsx
*.xls
# .json under data/raw etc. is already excluded by the data/ rule above
# (we do not globally ignore *.json, so the configs/*.json template stays trackable)

# Exception: commit only the human-validated label file (not regenerable, input to 02) — overrides data/ and *.csv
!data/
data/*
!data/processed_20250904/
data/processed_20250904/*
!data/processed_20250904/app_target_users_validated.csv
# Exception: masked analysis dataset (25,014 reviews; rating + factor scores + group) — reproduces the reported statistics
!data/processed_20250904/analysis_dataset.csv
# Exception: de-identified app-level selection table (aggregate app metadata only, NO review text) —
# makes the app-inclusion step (review-count / recency / installs filters) transparent and verifiable
!data/processed_20250904/app_selection_table.csv
# Exception: review-text-REMOVED app JSON (per-review timestamps/scores + app metadata, NO review body) —
# the runnable input for the provided track's selection step (02_preprocess_provided)
!data/processed_20250904/app_selection_input_notext_20250904.json

# Raw Google Play JSON is intentionally NOT published (holds review free-text + per-review timestamps;
# restricted by PII and the Google Play ToS). It is kept local only — data/raw/ stays fully ignored.
# Reproducibility of the app-selection step is provided instead via the de-identified
# data/processed_20250904/app_selection_table.csv (whitelisted above).

